{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_07_end","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":16,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_07_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-7","storyName":"烧灯者","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"为了给故事找到结局，作家开始讲述第三个故事：布莉吉与“放逐王”订下赌约，拉芙希妮抗击黑雾，而涅梅丝去宣告红龙的死亡。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_07_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_07","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":14,"next":16,"characters":["布莉吉","“放逐王”","拉芙希妮","涅梅丝"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read3","id":3},{"type":"dialog","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_weaamonologue_3","channel":"read3","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>从前有一位母亲，她曾是一国的国王，却被仇敌夺去了王冠和亲人。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>万幸她有一位强大的女儿，她的女儿与黑林中的黑雾签下契约，合力赶走了仇敌，女儿为母亲夺回了王国，黑雾则取回了不被打搅的安宁。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>母亲决定为女儿举办一场盛大的加冕仪式，可就在仪式开始前，女儿突然死于非命。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>母亲万分悲伤，继而变得狂怒，一心要为女儿复仇，复仇的狂热最终成为一股几乎将整个王国烧尽的烈焰。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>可烈焰太过旺盛，惊扰了刚刚睡下的黑雾。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>黑雾勒令母亲安分守己，不然就要将她拖入黑暗，而母亲在悲伤中认定黑雾就是夺走女儿生命的东西，决定拼死一搏。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","id":17},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"3","channel":"read3","id":18},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read3","id":23},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_59_g2_citystreets_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":25},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":26,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝、苇草......","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"在城门口，游牧民最后一次望向远方的堡垒。","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"突然浓烈起来的焦煳味让她想拔腿就跑。她明白这意味着什么。","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"可无论拉芙希妮是否成功，自己都应当像涅梅丝说的，立刻离开城市，去找守灵人，去请他们过来，越快越好。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"但涅梅丝说话时尽管强硬，却怎么都不像是相信事情有转机，也不像相信自己能请来守灵人。","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"刺鼻的焦煳味同样从涅梅丝身上散发出来，让布莉吉想起只有死者才会有的偏执。","id":36},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","duration":"1.5","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"还在等谁呢？等死亡摸到你的后脑勺，再和它比比谁跑得快吗？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......谁？","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哦，我都忘了，你能听见我说话。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我能听见。我甚至能感受到你就在那里......但我看不见你。","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"赶快离开这座城市吧，局外人。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"听你说话，你好像也是局外人？","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"当然。局外人好心提醒另一个局外人，这不是天经地义的事吗？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"布莉吉，活着。活着比什么都重要。最迟到明天的太阳升起之前，这座城市一定会死去。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"听涅梅丝的话，去找她的同族，然后跑得远远的，再也不要回来。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......你说得对，我该走了。","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"但我会回来。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#7$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"回来？！","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哈，愚蠢和倔强还真是代代相传！","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"她拼了命把你往城外赶，你却要傻乎乎地自己跑回来？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"果然，你也觉得涅梅丝只是在找个借口让我活下来，是吗？","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"不然呢？你以为自己能说动那些木头脑袋？你就用手拽吧，看看明年春天会不会有一个木头脑袋发了芽，愿意跟你进黑林！","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我讨厌你现在说话的腔调，看不见的弟兄。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你管我叫什么？弟兄？","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你身上的煳味难闻得要命，煳味之外的部分却又和游牧人有点像，我不知道你到底和我们有没有关系，干脆就这么叫你了。","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈哈！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#11$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"来打个赌吧，布莉吉！","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#11$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"打赌？","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"赌你离开之后，不可能在今夜，在纳斯尔纱焚尽之前回来。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你要赌的明明就不是这个。","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哦？那你说我赌的是什么？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你只想证明自己是对的，活下去比什么都重要。你觉得我最终也会这么做。","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"但是，我跟你赌。","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"那你还等什么？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"只是觉得不太公平。如果你赢了，我会后悔一辈子。可要是我赢了，你也不过是看戏而已。","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"要是我赢了，就回你该回的地方吧，好吗？","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你觉得我该回哪里？","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我不知道，可你的家肯定不在这里。","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你好像被这座城市里的人狠狠地背叛过，可你又狠不下心去伤害他们。","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你装作乐意看人自食其果的样子，可你刚刚说城市就要烧毁的时候......其实一点都不开心。","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你是我见过最别扭的家伙——","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#6$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"够了！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#6$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"none","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":108},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_59_i09.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":114},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"35","block":"false","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我答应你。要是你赢了，我就该回哪去回哪去。","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"但这可是件大事，不是你傻乎乎地跑回来送死就能办成的。","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"那你还需要我做什么？","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"帮我向城外那帮木头脑袋们传个话，你就说......","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"（古老的廷盖语）“已经六百多年，早就没人怨你们了，赶紧去做你们应该做的。”","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哦，再加一句，（古老的廷盖语）“我真是*粗口*了，一帮永远不开窍的木头脑袋！”","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"啊......啊？","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"连同那句粗口，给我向那群蠢货一字一句地复述下来，听见了吗？用不用我再骂一次？","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不、不用，族中的长老偶尔会用这种语言交谈，我多少听得懂......","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"那就去吧。","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"还等什么？","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你跟我绕了这么大弯子，就只是在犹豫要不要把这句话告诉我，是吗？","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......现在，立刻，给我跑起来！","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"金发的游牧人深吸了一口气，奔向城外。","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"而她终究没能看见的先祖一个人伫立在原地，久久没有挪动一步。","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"愚蠢和倔强......","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......还真是代代相传啊。","id":135},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"image","id":141},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"text","text":"涅梅丝转身离开，拉芙希妮则望向黑林。","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"太阳已经落到地平线下，宵禁即将生效。","id":147},{"type":"text","text":"而她远远望见，比任何时候都要浓烈的黑雾，正从林中向纳斯尔纱蔓延。","id":148},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_59_g2_citystreets_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":154},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":155,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","duration":"1.5","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"呼、呼......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"赶上了......","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"她对着城外的黑雾举起手中的枪，在满城的紫色中点亮一盏明黄色的火焰。","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"就好像接收到什么信号一样，雾气缓缓爬升，直至与拉芙希妮枪尖的火齐平。","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"来这里，来温暖的、光亮的、还有生命留存的地方......对，来这里。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"怎么，这次又要假装我不存在吗？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我不会让你们如愿的。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"在真正的黑暗到来之前，我决不会熄灭这盏灯火。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"charslot","id":174},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodcracle","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireburst","volume":"1","text":"","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"255","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":183},{"type":"text","text":"雾气被她手中的火吸引，却又无法靠近，于是顺着街道流淌开去。","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"过不多久，雾气再回来时，却已经不再是她的火焰能吸引、能驱散得了的了。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"雾中有如金铁交鸣，她突然觉得眼前的一切都一下子变暗——","id":186},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","layer":"1","id":191},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"none","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"黑雾降临了。","id":195},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这就是你的答案？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":197},{"type":"subtitle","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"对，这就是我的答案......","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"它还没有完成，它还需要时间。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"none","id":203},{"type":"subtitle","text":"时间是你的敌人，而非朋友。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":204},{"type":"subtitle","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"那可说不准。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"人们还没有在死火中彻底沦为僵死或狂暴的行尸，他们还活着，他们还来得及把火还回去。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"在涅梅丝将人们唤醒之前，你哪里都别想去。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"none","id":212},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可笑......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":213},{"type":"subtitle","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可笑？也许吧。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"和你相比，也许我的力量、我的智慧、我的法术的确都微不足道到可笑的地步。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但我所拥有的，唯有决心。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"bgeffect","id":225},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_bg_59_g12_castlecorridor_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":227},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":228,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":232},{"type":"charslot","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"涅梅丝一路将棺椁拖上长廊。","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"红龙的遗骸没有燃烧，只是静静躺在那里。","id":235},{"type":"text","text":"对普通人来说，死亡就该是这副样子，可对涅梅丝而言，她甚至能听见有缥缈的声音正在耳边嘲笑自己。","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"离群的守灵人没有任何踌躇，就将那瘫软的身体拉了起来，扔进棺椁。","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"棺椁，红龙，你最后的归宿......","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你们这样的人都该早早回到这样的归宿。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你现在还在什么地方，还带着你那扭曲的笑容看着我们吗？","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"但至少这具躯壳你已经再也无法掌控了，否则你现在就该把我烧成灰烬，是不是？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"哦，还有你从不离身的这杆长枪......你曾从中喷出多少火焰，又害了多少个像库林那样的人？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"看，你自己都不知道了。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"涅梅丝费力地举起那杆长枪，把枪尖狠狠扎进棺椁之中。","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"仅仅一瞬，火焰就从枪尖蔓延到整个棺椁，然后顺着用来把棺椁和涅梅丝连在一起的绳子一路烧过，和涅梅丝自己身上的紫火融为一体。","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"几乎致命的寒冷瞬间爬过涅梅丝全身，但她已经很难感觉到什么温度了。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"认命吧，你现在由我摆布了。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"库林下定的决心，没有做完的事情，我会替他完成。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我们走吧，去那些低贱的、受蔑视的，却在你窃取了胜利的这场战争中受苦的地方。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"你会被所有人看见，你的死亡会印在所有人眼中。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"他们会意识到，你死了。那高傲的、不可一世的红龙死了。爱布拉娜·都柏林就躺在这冰冷地燃烧着的棺椁之中。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"然后......他们会怎么做呢？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我当然希望他们能和拉芙希妮预想的一样，在得知你的死讯之后清醒过来。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"他们会知道你所代表的时日已经结束，纳斯尔纱会从这场灾难中死里逃生，塔拉不必用一座城市的毁灭来庆祝自己的新生。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"但是，哈哈......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我一定是被你的火也搞得晕头转向了，红龙。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"为什么我突然觉得另一个结局......毁灭的结局......也不坏呢？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"毕竟杀了你的另有其人，而现在......","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"现在才是我对你的复仇啊。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"棺椁仍然默然无语，涅梅丝也不再说话。","id":273},{"type":"text","text":"她沉默、癫狂而坚定地把那具燃烧的棺椁拖下楼梯，刻意让它和每一级台阶磕碰，发出不知是碰撞还是摩擦的怪声......","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"宛如死者干枯的嘲弄。","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":279},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read3","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"background","id":282},{"type":"image","id":283}],"characters":["布莉吉","“放逐王”","拉芙希妮","涅梅丝"]}